    "answer": {
      "short": "$432$",
      "worked": "Let $A$ be the arrangements with a vowel first and $B$ those with a vowel last. The vowels are $a$ and $e$. For both endpoints to be vowels, these two letters can be placed in $2\\times1$ ways.\n$$\\begin{align*}|A|&=2\\times5!=240\\\\|B|&=2\\times5!=240\\\\|A\\cap B|&=2\\times1\\times4!=48\\\\|A\\cup B|&=240+240-48=432.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
